738,2024-06-23 00:00:00,2024,"Department for Work and Pensions (DWP) Algorithm Wrongly Flags 200,000 for Housing Benefit Fraud","A Department for Work and Pensions (DWP) algorithm wrongly flagged over 200,000 UK housing benefit claims as high risk, resulting in unnecessary investigations. Two-thirds of these flagged claims were legitimate, causing wasted public funds and stress for claimants. Despite initial success in a pilot, the algorithm's real-world performance fell short. This incident highlights the risks of overreliance on automated systems in welfare administration.",Department For Work And Pensions,Department For Work And Pensions,"Uk General Public, Uk Housing Benefit Claimants",642188372947D07020C1319D,,2024-06-27 21:09:13,,MIT,5,Discrimination and Toxicity,Unequal performance across groups,AI,Unintentional,Post-deployment,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,2,Unintentional AI misuse
739,2024-06-27 00:00:00,2024,Scammers Allegedly Use Deepfake of Hong Kong Entertainer Andy Lau to Steal NT$2.64 Million from Fan,"Scammers allegedly defrauded a woman in New Taipei City of NT$2.64 million (US$81,116) by impersonating Hong Kong entertainer Andy Lau using purported deepfakes. The alleged scam convinced the victim, a long-time fan, through a video call that ""Lau"" needed funds for a visit to Taiwan. The victim reportedly wired the money, but her family suspected a scam and involved the police. An alleged scammer was arrested after attempting to collect a staged cash payment. ","Scammers, Scammers Impersonating Andy Lau","Deepfake Technology Developers, Synthetic Audio Generation Technology Developers","Lin (), Epistemic Integrity, Financial Scam Victims, Victims Of Deepfake Enabled Fraud, Fans Of Andy Lau","619B47Ea5Eed5334Edfa3Bbc, 642188372947D07020C1319D","Video Call Technology, Deepfake Technology, Synthetic Audio Generation Technology",2026-06-09 21:37:04,,MIT,2,Malicious Actors & Misuse,"Fraud, scams, and targeted manipulation",Human,Intentional,Post-deployment,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,1,Intentional human misuse
740,2024-07-10 00:00:00,2024,Department for Work and Pensions (DWP) AI Systems Allegedly Discriminate Against Single Mothers,"Researchers have argued that the Department for Work and Pensions' Universal Credit system disproportionately impacts single mothers. Automated processes in the system, designed to determine eligibility and detect fraud, are reported to have introduced biases, leading to financial instability and hardship. The algorithms allegedly miscalculate earnings and delay childcare reimbursements, in turn exacerbating income volatility and debt among single mothers.",Department For Work And Pensions,Department For Work And Pensions,"Single Mothers, British Single Mothers",642188372947D07020C1319D,,2024-07-18 01:34:20,,MIT,1,Discrimination and Toxicity,Unfair discrimination and misrepresentation,AI,Unintentional,Post-deployment,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,2,Unintentional AI misuse
742,2024-07-13 00:00:00,2024,Grok AI Model Reportedly Fails to Produce Reliable News in Wake of Trump Assassination Attempt,"xAI's model Grok, intended to automate news delivery on the X platform, is reported to have struggled to provide accurate information during the attempted assassination of former President Donald Trump. Grok apparently issued incorrect headlines, including false reports about Vice President Kamala Harris being shot and misidentifying the alleged shooter. These errors show the pitfalls of relying on AI for real-time news aggregation, as it allegedly amplified unverified claims and failed to recognize sarcasm, undermining its reliability.","X (Twitter), Elon Musk",Xai,"Kamala Harris, General Public, Donald Trump, Journalistic Integrity",642188372947D07020C1319D,,2024-07-23 02:21:01,"Incident 750 is closely related to this incident. This incident focuses on Grok AI's performance in the wake of the Trump assassination attempt. Incident 750 discusses a variety of different chatbots' performances, but does not mention Grok AI, in the wake of both the Trump assassination attempt and Biden dropping out of the presidential election.",MIT,1,Misinformation,False or misleading information,AI,Unintentional,Post-deployment,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,1,Unintentional AI misuse
743,2024-07-16 00:00:00,2024,Gemini AI Allegedly Reads Google Drive Files Without Explicit User Consent,"Kevin Bankston, a privacy activist, claims that Google's Gemini AI scans private Google Drive PDFs without explicit user consent. Bankston reports that after using Gemini on one document, the AI continues to access similar files automatically. Google disputes these claims, stating that Gemini requires proactive user activation and operates within privacy-preserving settings.","Google, Gemini","Google, Large Language Model Developers","Kevin Bankston, Google Users, Google Drive Users, Privacy",642188372947D07020C1319D,"Gemini, Chatbots, Large Language Models",2026-05-29 16:03:41,,MIT,1,Privacy & Security,"Compromise of privacy by obtaining, leaking or correctly inferring sensitive information",AI,Unintentional,Post-deployment,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,2,Unintentional AI misuse
