1230,2024-07-11 00:00:00,2024,"Suspect in Palisades Fire Allegedly Consulted ChatGPT for Arson Tips and Legal Advice Before Blaze That Killed 12 and Destroyed 6,837 Structures","Federal prosecutors allege that Jonathan Rinderknecht, arrested on 10/08/2025, consulted ChatGPT for arson-related imagery and legal advice before and after deliberately starting the Palisades fire in Los Angeles on 01/01/2025. The blaze, which reignited on 01/07/2025, killed 12 people and destroyed 6,873 buildings. Prosecutors say he generated a dystopian fire image with ChatGPT and later asked about liability for fires caused by cigarettes.",Jonathan Rinderknecht,Openai,"General Public Of California, General Public Of Los Angeles, Pacific Palisades Community, Victims Of The Palisades Fire",642188372947D07020C1319D,Chatgpt,2025-10-11 00:00:00,"Timeline note: Although the Palisades fire itself was allegedly set on 01/01/2025, we use 07/11/2024 as the incident date because this is when prosecutors say the suspect first used ChatGPT in connection with the event (reportedly generating an arson-themed image months before the fire). This marks the earliest point at which the AI system was implicated in the chain of events. Federal authorities announced Rinderknecht's arrest and charges on 10/08/2025.",MIT,1,Malicious Actors & Misuse,"Fraud, scams, and targeted manipulation",Human,Intentional,Post-deployment,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,1,Intentional human misuse
